BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jaws
DTSTART:20250829T220000Z
DTEND:20250830T002500Z
DTSTAMP:20250829T220000Z
UID:e6JwGkNkCI
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 124 mins (2h04m)\n\nOriginally released on June 20\,
  1975\, Jaws\, based on the best-selling novel by Peter Benchley\, became 
 the first true summer blockbuster and a cultural tsunami. Celebrate 50 yea
 rs of Jaws with this new 4K restoration\, with four screenings presented i
 n 3D. Tickets on sale 8:00am PT on Tuesday\, July 15. No OCAP for the 6:15
 pm 3D screening on August 31 3D screenings:Friday\, August 29 - 3:00pmSatu
 rday\, August 30 - 9:30pmSunday\, August 31 - 6:15pmMonday\, September 1 -
  3:45pm Open Caption screenings:Sunday\, August 31 - 12:00pm\, 3:00pm\, 9:
 30pmTuesday\, September 2 - 3:45pm\, 7:00pm\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema
 /in-theaters/jaws
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
